  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:16px 'Times New Roman';color:#1b1c1d;\"><span style=\"font-family:'TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\">Affiliate Program Description: Purrrfect Protections</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:16px 'Times New Roman';color:#1b1c1d;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:16px 'Times New Roman';color:#1b1c1d;\"><span style=\"font-family:'TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\">Program Overview:</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:16px 'Times New Roman';color:#1b1c1d;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\">Join the architecture of change. Purrrfect Protections is more than a pet safety brand; we are a social enterprise dedicated to re-architecting feline welfare through proactive safety and social research. We are looking for passionate affiliates—feline advocates, interior designers, and welfare professionals—to help us grow our national ecosystem. By promoting our systems, you aren't just earning a commission; you are directly funding national social research projects that prove proactive safety reduces rescue abandonment.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:16px 'Times New Roman';color:#1b1c1d;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:16px 'Times New Roman';color:#1b1c1d;\"><span style=\"font-family:'TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\">Why Partner With Us?</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:16px 'Times New Roman';color:#1b1c1d;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 27.4px;text-indent:-27.4px;font:16px 'Times New Roman';color:#1b1c1d;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\">• </span><span style=\"font-family:'TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\">High-Ticket Commissions:</span><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\"> Earn competitive rates on our bespoke Cat Fencing and Catio installations.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 27.4px;text-indent:-27.4px;font:16px 'Times New Roman';color:#1b1c1d;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 27.4px;text-indent:-27.4px;font:16px 'Times New Roman';color:#1b1c1d;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\">• </span><span style=\"font-family:'TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\">Recurring Revenue:</span><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\"> Earn ongoing commissions on our digital membership tiers—The Purrrfect Loop Newsletter (£1–£5) and our digital/print magazine.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 27.4px;text-indent:-27.4px;font:16px 'Times New Roman';color:#1b1c1d;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 27.4px;text-indent:-27.4px;font:16px 'Times New Roman';color:#1b1c1d;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\">• </span><span style=\"font-family:'TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\">Exclusive Resources:</span><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\"> Access to professional media kits, 3D CAD design renders, and logic-based creative assets to share with your audience.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 27.4px;text-indent:-27.4px;font:16px 'Times New Roman';color:#1b1c1d;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 27.4px;text-indent:-27.4px;font:16px 'Times New Roman';color:#1b1c1d;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\">• </span><span style=\"font-family:'TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\">Social Impact:</span><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\"> Be part of a \"Prevention over Cure\" mission. Every sale helps fund our National Welfare Study and supports our charity partners.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 27.4px;text-indent:-27.4px;font:16px 'Times New Roman';color:#1b1c1d;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 27.4px;text-indent:-27.4px;font:16px 'Times New Roman';color:#1b1c1d;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\">• </span><span style=\"font-family:'TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\">AI-Powered Support:</span><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\"> Benefit from our integrated \"Digital Switchboard\" (Bloot AI &amp; AppsFlyer), ensuring every referral is tracked with 100% accuracy and leads are nurtured automatically.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 27.4px;text-indent:-27.4px;font:16px 'Times New Roman';color:#1b1c1d;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:16px 'Times New Roman';color:#1b1c1d;\"><span style=\"font-family:'TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\">Our Target Audience:</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:16px 'Times New Roman';color:#1b1c1d;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 27.4px;text-indent:-27.4px;font:16px 'Times New Roman';color:#1b1c1d;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\">• Homeowners in the UK and Ireland seeking high-standard garden safety.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 27.4px;text-indent:-27.4px;font:16px 'Times New Roman';color:#1b1c1d;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\">• Feline welfare supporters and rescue volunteers.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 27.4px;text-indent:-27.4px;font:16px 'Times New Roman';color:#1b1c1d;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\">• Tech-forward pet parents interested in well-being and logic-based enrichment.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 27.4px;text-indent:-27.4px;font:16px 'Times New Roman';color:#1b1c1d;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:16px 'Times New Roman';color:#1b1c1d;\"><span style=\"font-family:'TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\">Commission Structure:</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:16px 'Times New Roman';color:#1b1c1d;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 27.4px;text-indent:-27.4px;font:16px 'Times New Roman';color:#1b1c1d;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\">• </span><span style=\"font-family:'TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\">Bespoke Installations:</span><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\"> Fixed referral fee per successful installation.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 27.4px;text-indent:-27.4px;font:16px 'Times New Roman';color:#1b1c1d;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\">• </span><span style=\"font-family:'TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\">Digital Ecosystem:</span><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\"> Percentage of monthly recurring subscription revenue.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 27.4px;text-indent:-27.4px;font:16px 'Times New Roman';color:#1b1c1d;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\">• </span><span style=\"font-family:'TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\">E-commerce:</span><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\"> Commission on all retail products </span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 27.4px;text-indent:-27.4px;font:16px 'Times New Roman';color:#1b1c1d;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:16px 'Times New Roman';color:#1b1c1d;\"><span style=\"font-family:'TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\">How to Get Started:</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:16px 'Times New Roman';color:#1b1c1d;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:16px 'Times New Roman';color:#1b1c1d;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;\">Apply now to become an \"Architecture Lead\" in our affiliate network. We provide a 10% discount code for your followers to help drive conversions and ensure your community feels the immediate benefit of our partnership.</span></p><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\"></div></div>",
